# Copy to .pii-names (gitignored, NEVER committed) and fill in.
#
# One `grep -E` pattern per line. Every client name, contact name, nickname and
# misspelling that must not appear anywhere in this PUBLIC repo — in file
# contents, in filenames, or in directory names. Matching is case-insensitive.
#
# Both ./scripts/pii-sweep.sh and the pre-commit hook read this file and refuse
# to run without it. Blank lines and #-comments are ignored.
#
# Examples (delete these, they are placeholders):
# Firstname|Nickname|Mispeling
# Lastname
# AcmeCorp|Acme Corp
